The consumption field is calculated automatically:
\[
\text{Consumption}=\text{Current Reading}-\text{Previous Reading}
\]

When the current reading is entered, the consumption value updates immediately.

If the current reading is lower than the previous reading:
- Do not silently accept it.
- Display an error.
- Offer the authorised meter-reset or replacement correction process.
If the reading is unusually high:
- Show a warning.
- Ask for a reason or review.
- Do not automatically discard the reading.
The reading should have an approval process before billing.

